cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SWOT Explorer in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "SWOT Explorer: a browser extension to search, preview, clip and download SWOT satellite hydrology data"
abstract: >-
  SWOT Explorer is a browser extension for Chrome and Edge that searches, previews, clips and
  downloads Surface Water and Ocean Topography (SWOT) satellite data for rivers, lakes, reservoirs
  and ocean. It builds quality-controlled water level, area and storage time series, grades their
  reliability, and compares them with gauge records and independent altimetry.
